    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "It's time to take a short, yet relaxing, walk!<br><br>Take a stroll around town and outside of it in this beautiful walking-sim, adventure game. Explore the shops and vistas in the area during day, night, sunrise. or sunset based on real-world time. Share in the emotions when surprising events unfold. Maybe you'll even find some secrets!<br><br><strong>Interact with the world through a variety of hand-drawn perspectives.</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2220770/extras/6c02a5b631230ae259bd5d558338db03.poster.avif?t=1745388052\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2220770/extras/6c02a5b631230ae259bd5d558338db03.webm?t=1745388052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2220770/extras/6c02a5b631230ae259bd5d558338db03.mp4?t=1745388052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Modes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore: A mode to wander the small town looking for new places to see.<br></li><li>Scavenger Hunt: Try to find all of the objects from a random list.<br></li><li>Hide-and-Seek: A friend is hiding somewhere in town; try to find them.<br></li><li>Stroll: Use the game as background ambience while you do something else.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A short, slow-paced walking experience!<br></li><li>Wander the town during 4 unique periods of the real-world day (morning, midday, evening, night).<br></li><li>Find and use various items to reach new places.<br></li><li>Interact with many interesting secrets hidden about.<br></li><li>Non-linear exploration.<br></li><li>Charming animation creates uniquely cinematic gameplay.<br></li><li>A variety of stunning locales.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "It's time to take a short, yet relaxing, walk!<br><br>Take a stroll around town and outside of it in this beautiful walking-sim, adventure game. Explore the shops and vistas in the area during day, night, sunrise. or sunset based on real-world time. Share in the emotions when surprising events unfold. Maybe you'll even find some secrets!<br><br><strong>Interact with the world through a variety of hand-drawn perspectives.</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2220770/extras/6c02a5b631230ae259bd5d558338db03.poster.avif?t=1745388052\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2220770/extras/6c02a5b631230ae259bd5d558338db03.webm?t=1745388052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2220770/extras/6c02a5b631230ae259bd5d558338db03.mp4?t=1745388052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Modes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore: A mode to wander the small town looking for new places to see.<br></li><li>Scavenger Hunt: Try to find all of the objects from a random list.<br></li><li>Hide-and-Seek: A friend is hiding somewhere in town; try to find them.<br></li><li>Stroll: Use the game as background ambience while you do something else.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A short, slow-paced walking experience!<br></li><li>Wander the town during 4 unique periods of the real-world day (morning, midday, evening, night).<br></li><li>Find and use various items to reach new places.<br></li><li>Interact with many interesting secrets hidden about.<br></li><li>Non-linear exploration.<br></li><li>Charming animation creates uniquely cinematic gameplay.<br></li><li>A variety of stunning locales.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Take a brief stroll in the beautiful walking-sim, adventure game: Walk and Stroll! See the sights, find items, and interact with things around town to make the impassable passable.",
